# Rendered by GitHub as a "Cite this repository" button, and read by
# Zenodo when a release is archived. Keep it in step with .zenodo.json.
cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Blocked sites dataset: which websites are measurably blocked,
  by country and month
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite both it and OONI, whose
  measurements it is derived from.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: Yuix Networks Inc
    website: "https://yuix.org"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22769312"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Yuix-Networks/blocked-sites-dataset"
url: "https://www.unblockmaster.com/internet-censorship-tracker/"
abstract: >-
  Per-country, per-domain website reachability derived from OONI's public
  web_connectivity measurements, published as one CSV per month. Confirmed
  blocks and anomalies are recorded as separate columns and must never be
  summed: the first means censorship was positively identified, the second
  means a connection failed in a way that censorship causes and so does an
  ordinary outage.
keywords:
  - internet censorship
  - website blocking
  - network measurement
  - OONI
  - internet freedom
  - open data
license: CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0
references:
  - type: data
    title: OONI measurement data
    authors:
      - name: Open Observatory of Network Interference
    url: "https://ooni.org"
    license: CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0
